00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:04.270
In fact, they can do the opposite, as you
say.

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:10.070
People can see that as a threat and further
kind of plant their feet in where they are.

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:15.540
What are the more effective ways to get people
to reconsider their beliefs and to throw out

