00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:45.570
the cost issue, when in reality that may not
be the primary reason I might want to end

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.570
the death penalty.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:49.030
There's debate over whether that's a good
idea or a bad idea.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:50.030
Ballpark.

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:54.950
For us, the best strategies for effectively
getting people to change their beliefs.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.170
I agree with that.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:01.890
There's a lot of talk about message framing,
